{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2023-04-13 07:00:00', 'title': 'ENHANCE YOUR CHARTPLOTTER EXPERIENCE WITH GARMIN NAVIONICS VISION+ PREMIUM MARINE MAPPING', 'text': "OLATHE, KAN., APRIL 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GARMIN (NYSE: GRMN), THE WORLD'S MOST INNOVATIVE AND RECOGNIZED MARINE ELECTRONICS MANUFACTURER, TODAY ANNOUNCED EXPANDED AND ENHANCED HIGH-RESOLUTION RELIEF SHADING COVERAGE TO ITS GARMIN NAVIONICS VISION+™ PREMIUM MARINE CARTOGRAPHY. COMBINING COLOR AND SHADOW, RELIEF SHADING GIVES MARINERS AN EASY-TO-INTERPRET, CLEARER VIEW OF WHAT'S BELOW THE SURFACE THAN CONTOUR LINES ALONE – NOW AVAILABLE ON MORE THAN 40,000 ADDITIONAL LAKES."}